name: beam-campaign-api
description: Use the Campaign HTTP API — author and publish a campaign graph, drive its lifecycle, and read the send funnel.
---

# Campaign API

> For the rail a send node delivers on, load `beam-message-rail-federation`.

## High-Level Architecture

```
Client ──HTTP──▶ Gateway /api/campaigns ──▶ CampaignService ──▶ Mongo (graph, directory)
                                                │
                       publish preflight ───────┴──▶ rail federation CheckMessageRailConfig
                                                │
Campaign runtime ◀── directory desired state ───┘
  enrol → walk graph → Send node ──▶ Message Rail runtime ──▶ customer rail microservice
     ▲                                                              │
     └── analytics events (opened/clicked/goal) ◀── player / rail ──┘
                    │
                    ▼
        funnel buffer ──(flush)──▶ funnel counters ──(rollup)──▶ sealed totals ──▶ GET /funnel
```

